# SPA fallback for the vendored concept sites (2026-11-21): each concept
# is a client-side-routed SPA, so a direct load / refresh / bookmark of a
# sub-route (e.g. /concepts/tally-bar/shop) must serve the SPA's index.html
# with a 200, not the main site's 404 page. Cloudflare Pages serves an
# existing static file before applying these rules, so real assets under
# /concepts/<slug>/assets/ are unaffected.
/concepts/tally-bar/*  /concepts/tally-bar/index.html  200
/concepts/look-out-below/*  /concepts/look-out-below/index.html  200
/concepts/stitch-and-tan/*  /concepts/stitch-and-tan/index.html  200
/concepts/product-site/*  /concepts/product-site/index.html  200
/concepts/portfolio-concept/*  /concepts/portfolio-concept/index.html  200
